  "short_description": "《物質世界2：遠徵》是一款融合生存、探索與硬核戰鬥的開放世界ARPG。在這裡你不是天命之子，而是必須步步為營，對抗饑寒、管理揹包並在戰前做好萬全規劃的普通冒險者。前路嚴酷且未知，但每一次死裡逃生都將化為成長的養分。背起行囊，踏出城牆！一場足以讓你銘記的凡人史詩正等你啟程！",
  "short_description_en": "Outward 2 is a challenging action RPG with survival elements, focusing around a grounded experience. There’s no hand-holding, no scaled encounters, no divine blessings to make you tower over your enemies. Eat your meal, check your map, grab your backpack: an unforgiving, rewarding adventure awaits.",
